       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ORDRAUD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT AUDIT-FILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ORDAUD
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  AUDIT-FILE.
           COPY ORDAUDR.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TIMESTAMP          PIC X(26).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-AUDIT-DETAIL.
           05 LK-ORDER-ID        PIC X(10).
           05 LK-ACTION          PIC X(10).
           05 LK-RESULT          PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-AUDIT-DETAIL.
       MAIN-PROCESSING SECTION.
       A000-MAIN.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-TIMESTAMP
           MOVE LK-ORDER-ID TO AUDIT-ORDER-ID
           MOVE LK-ACTION TO AUDIT-ACTION
           MOVE LK-RESULT TO AUDIT-RESULT
           MOVE WS-TIMESTAMP TO AUDIT-TIMESTAMP
           OPEN EXTEND AUDIT-FILE
           WRITE AUDIT-RECORD
           CLOSE AUDIT-FILE
           GOBACK.
